      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "type": "quick-answer",
      "callout": "Jeweller's Orbs set the support-socket count directly: Lesser to 3, Greater to 4, Perfect to 5. They do not add one socket at a time.",
      "calloutDetail": [
        "Using a lower tier cannot reduce an already-higher count.",
        "From 0.5 they can also be used on items that grant skills."
      ],
