          "label": "Use it",
          "text": [
            "Use the tier that matches the support count you want."
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Sell it",
          "text": [
            "Sell the tier you do not need if a higher one is cheaper."
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Hold it",
          "text": [
            "Hold Perfect for your final main-skill setup."
